From: Jonas Salo <salomannen1234@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 20:24:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 12/19] camera: stop forcing aux camera package allowlist

Drop the vendor.camera.aux.packagelist product property so the build no
longer forces an aux-camera exposure allowlist. The property whitelists
packages that may enumerate auxiliary (hidden physical) camera IDs;
carrying it here was dodge-port carry-over (59fd9a6 used
com.oplus.camera), while OP15InfinityX observed that forcing a broad
list exposes aux cameras to regular apps (Aperture picking up aux
sensors) and removed it.

Stock OOS 16.0.8 ships vendor.camera.aux.packagelist=org.codeaurora.snapcam
in system/build.prop (a package absent from the device), i.e. no real
package is allowlisted on the baseline and OplusCamera does not depend
on this property for its own capture paths. Removing the line is
functionally equivalent to the OOS baseline for every real package.

Adapted-from: OP15InfinityX/android_device_oneplus_infiniti-camera@1f55ec3f2bbefbc4127f7406d05c37489f43b4e7 (https://github.com/OP15InfinityX/android_device_oneplus_infiniti-camera/commit/1f55ec3f2bbefbc4127f7406d05c37489f43b4e7)
Adaptation-notes: our tree carried =com.oplus.camera (not the =* the source commit removes); removed the whole line against opluscamera.mk's current property block. OOS baseline evidence: system/build.prop:190 in infiniti_CPH2745_OOS16.0.8_11.A.42 dump.
Change-Id: Ia994c661ce13bd9cf441f98d7023f1fd486b7365
---
 opluscamera.mk | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/opluscamera.mk b/opluscamera.mk
index f65f9a4..44aa959 100644
--- a/opluscamera.mk
+++ b/opluscamera.mk
@@ -56,7 +56,6 @@ PRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES += \
     ro.vendor.oplus.vendorxml.enable=1 \
     vendor.oplus.hdr.uniform.debug=1 \
     oplus.software.camera.10bit=1 \
-    vendor.camera.aux.packagelist=com.oplus.camera \
     ro.oplus.camera.facing.front.need.disable.nfc=1 \
     ro.oplus.camera.portrait.center.switch=oplus.switch.portrait.center \
     ro.oplus.camera.portrait_center.prefix=oplus.portrait.center. \
